{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>《7 Minute TV Workout》是一款為忙碌人士而設的 7 分鐘高強度循環訓練 App，提供 12 個科學實證動作、影片示範與語音指導，無需器材即可在 iPhone 或 iPad 上完成訓練。目前<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，原價 US $0.99。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-132.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>七分鐘高強度循環訓練</h2>\n<p>訓練以 12 個動作組成，每個動作進行 30 秒，之間休息 10 秒；App 提供高清影片示範、逐步語音指導、計時倒數與日曆活動記錄，亦可背景播放喜愛音樂。另有影片動作教學，讓使用者先了解要領再開始，並已為不同螢幕尺寸優化顯示。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1183\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2778x1284bb-scaled.jpg\" width=\"2560\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1183\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2778x1284bb-1-scaled.jpg\" width=\"2560\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1183\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2778x1284bb-2-scaled.jpg\" width=\"2560\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1183\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2778x1284bb-3-scaled.jpg\" width=\"2560\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：7 Minute TV Workout</li><li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/7-minute-tv-workout/id1052600695?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.279557+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":311,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T06:05:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T13: